※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4688
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4688 LANG_TYPE_ARGUMENT_NOT_A_TYPE

※ A parameter written `kind: ⌜T'⌝` is handed a type, lifted: `⌜u8⌝`.

fn zero(kind: ⌜T'⌝) → u8:
    0u8

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    let z := zero(3u8)
    if z = 0u8: 0u6 else: 1u6
